{!$Input:Document.Id}
You have received a set of image/PDF resumes from {!$RelatedList:Document.CombinedAttachments.Records}. Each file is one candidate.
AND {!$Input:Document.Email_Body__c} may also contain resume details so carefully get details from this as well
TASKS 1. Parse every resume and output one JSON object per file, using the exact schema below. 2. Populate real values; leave missing data blank or omit the field. 3. Get only latest completed degree only JSON format dont wrap inside ```json dont include any ``` in the beginning
